//////////////////
////////////////// Basic wave data
//////////////////
REG // Wave type. Available types: REG, IRR
2 // Wave height (significant for irregular) [m]
5.15789411187567 // Wave period (peak for irregular) [s]
13.90000020712614 // Wave heading (with respect to fixed frame) [deg]
//////////////////
////////////////// Irregular wave data
//////////////////
1 // Spectrum type [1: JONSWAP, 2: CUSTOM (Time-Domain), 3:CUSTOM (Frequency-Domain)]
0 // Split wave in pieces for faster diffraction forces computation? [0: no; 1: yes]
//// JONSWAP
3.3 // Peak enhacement factor for JONSWAP spectrum [gamma]
0.0 // Directional spreading factor [s, G(d) = cos^s(d)] [s<1: No directional spreading]
10.0 // Heading discretization step [deg] (must be a divisor of 360)
0.001 // Minumum proportion of the spectrum average to be included
0 // Flag to generate or read random phases [0: generate, 1: read]
0.05 // Generation: Relative tolerance for time series check
0.1 // Generation and reading: Time step for time series check
WavePhases.dat // Reading: Filename with the previously generated wave phases
//// CUSTOM
FIH21-00009_C1_JS_H2p25_T15_G1_ABS_WDT9_OPER20_00.dat // File with the wave data